）\nヒロインCD「先輩…そんなに私達のこと…（照」\nヒロインC、DがヒロインA、Bにキスを迫る。\nヒロインAB「違うから～！、んんぅ～～っ!?」\nヒロインC、DにキスされるヒロインA、B。\n唇を離し、\nヒロインCD「じゃあ次は先輩同士で♥」\nヒロインAB「え！？ちょっとま…、んんぅ～～っ!?」\nヒロインCDに押さえつけるようにキスさせられるヒロインAB\n\nヒロインAB「（声にならない悲鳴）、う゛ぇぇぇぇ…」\nヒロインABの叫びが響き渡る中、こっそり離脱し安堵する主人公「逃げ切った…」\n\n\n可能でしたらお願いします。", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1043109, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "イャクヮン", "screen_name": "YAKAN4771", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1613814794372648961/qihhRIoL.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/836714305/1726591600/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 3, "complete_expiration_days": 14, "skills": [{"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 32}, {"id": 1251317, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "戦場のぺんつ", "screen_name": "1101simotuki", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1458980992447029248/5ves1NYy.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/3312875082/1745514042/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 10, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "banned": false, "nc": 160}, {"id": 3327747, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "🍞が好き", "screen_name": "iroiro1729", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1852942703732178944/LKd_yFuQ.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1193421317715836929/1716382731/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank"